# Floor, not a pin: django-anymail 15 pulls in amazon-s3-encryption-client-python,
# which caps cryptography below 49 and so drags it BACKWARDS from 50 to 48. A
# security library does not move backwards to satisfy an email SDK. Remove this
# once that cap lifts and anymail can move again.
cryptography>=50

